### New Package: `dine_ai/capabilities/`

#### [NEW] [base.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/capabilities/base.py)

Core abstractions.

```
ColumnRequirement (Enum)  — MANDATORY | RECOMMENDED | OPTIONAL
CapabilityStatus  (Enum)  — ENABLED | DISABLED | PARTIAL
CapabilityResult  (DC)    — name, status, reason, available_columns, missing_required, missing_optional
BaseCapability    (ABC)   — name, required_columns, optional_columns, required_values, description, detect(df)
```

`BaseCapability.detect(df)` checks:
1. All `required_columns` are present → ENABLED
2. Some `required_columns` missing → DISABLED + reason
3. `required_values` (e.g. `item_type IN [drink, coffee]`) validated → PARTIAL if values absent

