### Modified: `dine_ai/llm/prompts.py`

#### [MODIFY] [prompts.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/llm/prompts.py)

1. Update `LOCALIZATION_DATA` to use `menu_item_name` / `menu_item` keys
